<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγελως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>derision</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δῆτ᾽ ἐμαυτῆς
				καταγέλωτ᾽ ἔχω τάδε</span>; these ornaments <i>which
				bring ridicule</i> upon me? <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1264
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γέλωτος ἄξιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					13.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πλατύς</span> sheer
			<i>mockery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγελων . . φίλοις παρασχεθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					319
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλοῦν προσλήψῃ -γέλωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epict.
					<u>Ench.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῆς πράξεως</span>
			<i>the crowning absurdity</i> of the matter, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				45e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγελων ἡγούμην πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					7.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>laughing-stock</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗτος κ. νομίζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					160.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
